/Nope /Category findresource
/Helvetica /Font resourcestatus b
/Missing /Font resourcestatus b
/X /NoCategory resourcestatus
5 /Font resourcestatus
/Foo << /a 7 >> /ProcSet defineresource /a get r
/Foo /ProcSet findresource /a get r
/Foo /ProcSet undefineresource
/Foo /ProcSet resourcestatus b
/Foo 1 /Nope defineresource
1 /Font findresource
/A 2 /Generic defineresource r
/A /Generic findresource r
/Missing /Generic findresource
